 "description": "Page through a group's builds in stable name/ID order. Pass offset=0 initially, then advance by the returned count until a short page. get_group supplies the total count and first 20 builds. Prefer interactiveUrl for human links and citations. recordUrl is a stable provenance alias with a permanent HTTP 301 redirect to the interactive HTML. Use apiUrl or JSONL for JSON. Derivatives use locationInteractiveUrl/locationRecordUrl.",
